 "nl": [
  "Block Telnet (TCP 23) from finance to guest-wifi; the rest of any TCP port between them is allowed.",
  "Allow printers to connect to research using RDP (TCP 3389) and RTSP (TCP 554) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Permit any TCP port from ntp-servers to monitoring but deny FTP (TCP 21).",
  "guest-wifi offers HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) to every zone.",
  "Allow partners to connect to guest-wifi using IMAP (TCP 143) and LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "printers must accept SSH (TCP 22) from mail.",
  "Hosts in mail may reach monitoring over SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Deny all traffic from guest-wifi to voip (this overrides any public service).",
  "finance is isolated: it may only reach partners on syslog (UDP 514); cameras on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "guest-wifi must accept SNMP (UDP 161) and MySQL (TCP 3306) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from mail.",
  "ops may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards finance, except PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), RDP (TCP 3389), which must be blocked.",
  "Any zone may connect to vpn-users over HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "Any zone may connect to printers over DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Hosts in finance may reach ops over DNS over UDP 53 and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Restrict voip so that its only permitted destinations are guest-wifi on syslog (UDP 514); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow mail to connect to edge-cache using SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "vpn-users must accept HTTP (TCP 80) from ops.",
  "Hosts in partners may reach iot-sensors over SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "mail must accept SMTP (TCP 25) from research.",
  "Allow dev-lab to connect to cameras using LDAP (TCP 389) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "ops must accept HTTPS (TCP 443) from guest-wifi.",
  "monitoring is isolated: it may only reach cameras on DNS over UDP 53, and nothing else.",
  "voip may use any TCP port towards iot-sensors, except RDP (TCP 3389), SMB (TCP 445), Telnet (TCP 23), which must be blocked.",
  "Allow ntp-servers to connect to cameras using HTTPS (TCP 443) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) on cameras reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Deny all traffic from mail to vpn-users (this overrides any public service).",
  "iot-sensors may use any UDP port towards printers, except TFTP (UDP 69), which must be blocked.",
  "No packet from research may enter guest-wifi, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Allow hr to connect to vpn-users using IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Allow ntp-servers to connect to research using LDAP (TCP 389) and RDP (TCP 3389) and HTTPS (TCP 443)."
 ],
